  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoadingScreens_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 68e28738469fc1e47894c66d18f8b174, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2431639552
    m_Localized: Proles Caduca
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2570051584
    m_Localized: 'Rejected by the Bee Kingdom,

      this abomination makes even

      the
      bravest tremble.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3979337728
    m_Localized: Dracoleon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3979337729
    m_Localized: 'This creature, half dragon,

      half chameleon, serves the

      Bees.
      Enlist it and you will be able

      to copy the effects of other followers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4944027648
    m_Localized: Magus Mortis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4944027649
    m_Localized: 'Eager to collect new souls,

      it will give you some at the

      right
      moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5397012480
    m_Localized: "Chilosmod\xE9e"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5397012481
    m_Localized: The Elders say it hides within the Kingdom in the shape of a centipede.
      Make offerings to it, swear to serve it, and perhaps it will show itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5824831488
    m_Localized: The Bees
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5824831489
    m_Localized: Rulers of the Kingdom, will they be able to defend themselves against
      the threat you pose? Or will they let your words seduce them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6491725824
    m_Localized: Guide of Light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6491725825
    m_Localized: Of the Firefly family, the Guide of Light is a true warrior. Win
      it over to your cause to earn many souls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6814687232
    m_Localized: "Scortoph\xE9l\xE8s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6814687233
    m_Localized: "Hungry for destruction, Scortoph\xE9l\xE8s is eager to be summoned
      to put the Kingdom to fire and sword."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7167008768
    m_Localized: The Bees
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7167008769
    m_Localized: Find a way to tame the Bee people and bring down their Kingdom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7796154368
    m_Localized: "Belz\xE9rocera"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7796154369
    m_Localized: "Symbolic depiction of Belz\xE9rocera, God of the flying creatures.\nIt
      will stand by your side in your quest if you swear allegiance to it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8110727168
    m_Localized: Mantislith
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8110727169
    m_Localized: 'A female demon, she devours the hopes of new lives and terrorizes
      the Kingdom. Keep your head on your shoulders: if you worship her, she will
      grant you a certain power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8442077184
    m_Localized: The Fireflies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8442077185
    m_Localized: Active at night, they let you add followers to the Courtyard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9062834176
    m_Localized: The Mosquitoes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9062834177
    m_Localized: A band of mercenaries who will serve anyone, for a price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9616482304
    m_Localized: The Cultists
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9616482305
    m_Localized: Longing to bring their Occult Gods back to life, the Cultists will
      do anything to sacrifice souls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10157547520
    m_Localized: The Crickets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10157547521
    m_Localized: Will your song be like the Crickets' song? Sing the praises of your
      Occult Gods and enlist followers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10635698176
    m_Localized: The Scarabs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10635698177
    m_Localized: Will your words pierce the hard shell of the scarabs all the way
      to their heart?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11046739968
    m_Localized: The Flies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11046739969
    m_Localized: Approach them with caution, they will serve you if you know how
      to talk to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11428421632
    m_Localized: The Ladybugs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11428421633
    m_Localized: A symbol of luck, the ladybug will guide you. May your words bring
      you many followers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
